OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FPetroc introduces live music from
OL,7,     FLe Vent du Nord and chats to music
OL,8,     Fhistorian Ashley Kahn about John
OL,9,     FColtrane's musical legacy on the
OL,10,     F100th anniversary of his birth.
OL,11,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,12,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Fsoundscape of classical favourites
OL,14,     Ffrom Canteloube to Tchaikovsky.
OL,15,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,16,     FJohn Storgards and the BBC
OL,17,     FPhilharmonic in music by Sibelius
OL,18,     Fand Wagner. They are joined by
OL,19,     FJames McVinnie for Gabriella
OL,20,     FSmith's organ concerto 'Breathing
OL,21,     FForests'.
