OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Coltrane's Sound
OL,6,     FCarlos Santana remembers how he
OL,7,     Fwas inspired by the spiritual jazz
OL,8,     Fof John Coltrane. Presented by
OL,9,     FAshley Kahn.
OL,10,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,11,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Feverything in between.
OL,16,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,17,     FTonight, on the 100th birthday of
OL,18,     FJohn Coltrane, Soweto welcomes his
OL,19,     Fthird guest of the week, Shabaka,
OL,20,     Fto share some of the music by
OL,21,     FColtrane that has inspired him.
